===Etymology===
[[File:European Parliament Strasbourg 2015-10-28 02.jpg|thumb|The [[hemicycle]] of the [[European Parliament]] in [[Strasbourg]], [[France]]. The European Parliament exercises the [[lawmaking]] function of the [[European Union]], and thus contributes towards the EU’s acquis.]]

Shortened from {{m|en|acquis communautaire}}: {{bor|en|fr|acquis||that which has been acquired or obtained}} + {{m|fr|communautaire||of the community}}.

